<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · 提及、提出、阐明与插嘴 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Bringing up, Pointing out & Cutting in</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>77 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>将交谈视为共享桌面或容器——UP 是把话题端上台面（变为可见），OUT 是把要点从杂乱信息中挑出展示，IN 是强行挤入他人话语空间（插嘴）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>point <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (2.486x) + 作为正式词 [comment] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make or write a comment on</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>comment, notice</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He commented the paper of his colleague.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>talk <span class='pt-highlight'>about</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [discourse] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>to consider or examine in speech or writing</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>discourse, discuss</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The author <b>talks</b> <b>about</b> the different aspects of this question.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The class discussed Dante's `Inferno'.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>4/7</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>express with difficulty</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>say, tell</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>I managed to <b>get</b> <b>out</b> a few words.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>talk <span class='pt-highlight'>about</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>discuss or mention</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>talk, speak</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They spoke of many things.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>make <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 10 个核心义项'>7/10</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: suggest)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>imply or suggest</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>suggest, intimate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Your remarks <b>make</b> me <b>out</b> to be stupid.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>point <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (2.486x) + 作为正式词 [signalize] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>point out carefully and clearly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>signalize, signalise</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>point</b> it <b>out</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>point <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (2.486x)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>emphasize, especially by identification</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>stress, emphasize</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>This novel <b>points</b> <b>up</b> the racial problems in England.</div></div></div></td></tr>
