<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>thrash <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [discuss] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>discuss vehemently in order to reach a solution or an agreement</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>discuss</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The leaders of the various Middle Eastern countries are trying to hammer out a peace agreement.</div></div></div></td></tr>
