<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 批评、训斥、嘲弄与反驳 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Telling off, Lashing out & Talking back</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>45 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>利用 DOWN（打压对方高度/贬低）、ON¹（把攻击负担强加于某人身上）、OUT（情绪向外猛烈喷发）与 BACK（言语反击顶嘴）表达训斥与争辩。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
