<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 泄露、隐瞒、传开与坦白 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Giving away, Covering up & Opening up</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>38 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>秘密在容器内为隐瞒（hold back / keep in），用盖子盖住为掩盖（cover up），而一旦走出容器边界（let out / give away / leak out）即为泄密。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [submit] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>yield to another's wish or opinion</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>submit, bow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The government bowed to the military pressure.</div></div></div></td></tr>
