<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>away</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>4/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [deliver] 的日常短语替身 + 所属专业域为法律/金融/学术/文学' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>formally hand over to the bridegroom in marriage; of a bride by her father</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>deliver, render</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>give</b> it <b>away</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [emit] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>give off, send forth, or discharge; as of light, heat, or radiation, vapor, etc.</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>emit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The ozone layer blocks some harmful rays which the sun emits.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: fail)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>stop operating or functioning</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>fail, die</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The engine finally went.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The car died on the road.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>The bus we travelled in broke down on the way to town.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>tongue to</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [express] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>articulate; either verbally or with a cry, shout, or noise</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>express, verbalize</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She expressed her anger.</div></div>
