<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>let <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [admit] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>allow participation in or the right to be part of; permit to exercise the rights, functions, and responsibilities of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>admit, include</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Admit someone to the profession.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She was admitted to the New Jersey Bar.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>let <span class='pt-highlight'>on</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [unwrap] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make known to the public information that was previously known only to a few people or that was meant to be kept a secret</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>unwrap, disclose</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The auction house would not disclose the price at which the van Gogh had sold.</div></div>
