<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>gloss <span class='pt-highlight'>over</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [whitewash] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cover up a misdemeanor, fault, or error</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>whitewash, cover</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Let's not whitewash the crimes of Stalin.</div></div>
